<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏrōnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τορώνη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of
				Chalcidice in Macedonia</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 10, 17, § 37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 31, 51, §
			100</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 28, 7, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">44, 12, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">45, 30, 4</span></i>; <i>gen.</i> Toronae promontorium, <i><span class="en">id. 31,
				45, 15</span></i>. — Hence. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏrō-naeus</span></b> , a, um, <i>adj. of</i> or <i>belenging to
			Torone</i>, <i>Toronæan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinus,</span>”
				<i>the mod. Gulf of Kassandhra</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					5, 10</span></i>
			.—In <i>plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏrōnaei</span></b> ,
			ōrum. m., <i>the inhabitants of
				Torone</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 10, 17, § 35</span></i>.
			— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tŏrō-năĭcus</span></b> ,
			a. um. <i>adj., of Torone</i>, <i>Toronæan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					44, 11</span></i>
			. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
